{"id":"fc43d5bf9f72ed51","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-ax-hilbert-impl2.md","title":"Hilbert Axiom Schema 2 (Syllogism)","display":"ax-hilbert-impl2 — Hilbert Axiom Schema 2 (Syllogism)","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-ax-hilbert-impl2","aliases":["58-ax-hilbert-impl2"],"display":"ax-hilbert-impl2 — Hilbert Axiom Schema 2 (Syllogism)","depends_on":["[[58-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-ax-hilbert-impl2"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-ax-hilbert-impl2</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-hilbert-impl2 — Hilbert Axiom Schema 2 (Syllogism)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (形式语言签名, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi, \\psi, \\chi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(S)\">\\(\\varphi, \\psi, \\chi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(S)\\)</span> (签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 上的公式, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}impl2} \\vdash \\forall \\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(S)\\;((\\varphi\\to(\\psi\\to\\chi))\\to((\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\varphi\\to\\chi)))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}impl2} \\vdash \\forall \\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(S)\\;((\\varphi\\to(\\psi\\to\\chi))\\to((\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\varphi\\to\\chi)))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该公理表达蕴含式的<strong>正向分配律</strong>（syllogism）</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\psi \\to \\chi)\">\\((\\psi \\to \\chi)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span></li>\n<li>这是 Hilbert 系统推导命题逻辑重言式的核心公理</li>\n<li>公式域显式按语言签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 索引，避免把不同签名的公式混入同一公理实例。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ (形式语言签名, see [[58-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi, \\psi, \\chi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(S)$ (签名 $S$ 上的公式, see [[58-df-formula]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi, \\psi, \\chi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(S)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}impl2} \\vdash \\forall \\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(S)\\;((\\varphi\\to(\\psi\\to\\chi))\\to((\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\varphi\\to\\chi)))","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"(\\psi \\to \\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":976,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-ax-hilbert-impl2.md|58-ax-hilbert-impl2]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["65418b505fc53093"]}